  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Simple random, stratified and systematic sampling"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Simple random sampling (SRS): every unit has an equal chance; use the lottery method or random number tables (e.g. Tippett's). Stratified sampling: a varied population is divided into fairly uniform groups (strata) and an SRS is drawn from each; with proportional allocation $n_i = n \\times N_i/N$. Systematic sampling: list the units, find $k = N/n$, pick a random start r between 1 and k, then take r, r + k, r + 2k, …",
    "kn": "ಸರಳ ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ ಮಾದರಿ: ಪ್ರತಿ ಘಟಕಕ್ಕೆ ಸಮಾನ ಅವಕಾಶ (ಲಾಟರಿ, ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ ಸಂಖ್ಯಾ ಕೋಷ್ಟಕ). ಸ್ತರೀಕೃತ ಮಾದರಿ: ಸಮಷ್ಟಿಯನ್ನು ಸ್ತರಗಳಾಗಿ ವಿಂಗಡಿಸಿ ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದರಿಂದ ಆಯ್ಕೆ. ಕ್ರಮಬದ್ಧ ಮಾದರಿ: k = N/n, ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ ಆರಂಭ r, ನಂತರ r + k, r + 2k, …"
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "SRS: lottery or random numbers"
    },
    {
     "en": "Stratified: strata, then SRS in each"
    },
    {
     "en": "Systematic: every k-th unit after a random start"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Simple random sampling (SRS): every unit has an equal chance; use the lottery method or random number tables (e.g. Tippett's). Stratified sampling: a varied population is divided into fairly uniform groups (strata) and an SRS is drawn from each; with proportional allocation ni = n  times  Ni/N. Systematic sampling: list the units, find k = N/n, pick a random start r between 1 and k, then take r, r + k, r + 2k, …",
    "kn": "ಸರಳ ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ ಮಾದರಿ: ಪ್ರತಿ ಘಟಕಕ್ಕೆ ಸಮಾನ ಅವಕಾಶ (ಲಾಟರಿ, ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ ಸಂಖ್ಯಾ ಕೋಷ್ಟಕ). ಸ್ತರೀಕೃತ ಮಾದರಿ: ಸಮಷ್ಟಿಯನ್ನು ಸ್ತರಗಳಾಗಿ ವಿಂಗಡಿಸಿ ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದರಿಂದ ಆಯ್ಕೆ. ಕ್ರಮಬದ್ಧ ಮಾದರಿ: k = N/n, ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ ಆರಂಭ r, ನಂತರ r + k, r + 2k, …"
   },
   "formula": "k = \\frac{N}{n}, \\qquad n_i = n\\times\\frac{N_i}{N}"
  },
